<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

  <!--
    The Prowler's HARM and jamming pod brought in line with the Mk. 82 (0.37.0; owner's cards, 23 Nov 2026: real weights, intermediate
    parts, the pod raised as suggested; docs/development/aircraft-munitions.md). Both items exist only under Combat Extended, so each
    patch waits on its item. Stock, the HARM was worth about 400 silver and the pod about 340.

    AGM-88 HARM: 360 kg (800 lb), warhead 68 kg (150 lb), radar homing (US Navy fact file, archived 2004, primary); the author's CE
    weight was 80 kg. Its seeker is the missile seeker head (Mods/AircraftMunitions), with one more advanced component for its wide-band
    receivers; 150 steel less the head's 10 for the airframe and motor case; 15 FSX for the warhead (the Mk. 82's ratio, 0.23 per kg);
    150 chemfuel for the motor's propellant; 10 components. All but the weight and warhead AUTHORED. About 1,580 silver.

    AN/ALQ-99 pod: 431 kg (950 lb; Carlo Kopp, Australian Aviation, January 1989, secondary); the author's weight was 40 kg. A pod is
    used up into the jet's count when mounted (EWPods.cs), so its weight never rides on the jet as cargo. 80 steel, 20 gold for its
    transmitters' contacts and wave guides, 10 components and 2 advanced components, AUTHORED (owner's card). About 1,100 silver: four
    pods are about 4,400 on top of the jet.

    The HARM has no fixed market value of its own, nor the pod, so the game already works theirs out from the ingredients.
  -->
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Prowler_Ammo_HARM"]</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <operations>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Prowler_Ammo_HARM"]/costList</xpath>
          <value>
            <costList>
              <PhobosMissileSeekerHead>1</PhobosMissileSeekerHead>
              <Steel>140</Steel>
              <FSX>15</FSX>
              <Chemfuel>150</Chemfuel>
              <ComponentIndustrial>10</ComponentIndustrial>
              <ComponentSpacer>1</ComponentSpacer>
            </costList>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Prowler_Ammo_HARM"]/statBases/Mass</xpath>
          <value>
            <Mass>360</Mass>
          </value>
        </li>
        <!-- At The Dead Man's Switch's ammunition stamping machine too, as the bombs are (0.37.1, the owner's report of 23 Nov 2026). -->
        <li Class="PatchOperationConditional">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="DMS_TableAmmoPrinter"]</xpath>
          <match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
            <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Prowler_Ammo_HARM"]/recipeMaker/recipeUsers</xpath>
            <value>
              <li>DMS_TableAmmoPrinter</li>
            </value>
          </match>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Prowler_EWPod"]</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <operations>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Prowler_EWPod"]/costList</xpath>
          <value>
            <costList>
              <Steel>80</Steel>
              <Gold>20</Gold>
              <ComponentIndustrial>10</ComponentIndustrial>
              <ComponentSpacer>2</ComponentSpacer>
            </costList>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Prowler_EWPod"]/statBases/Mass</xpath>
          <value>
            <Mass>431</Mass>
          </value>
        </li>
        <!-- At The Dead Man's Switch - Expedition's precise fabrication center too, electronics rather than ammunition (0.37.1, agent's choice). -->
        <li Class="PatchOperationConditional">
          <success>Always</success>
          <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="DMSE_MicrogravityFacility"]</xpath>
          <match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
            <xpath>Defs/ThingDef[defName="Prowler_EWPod"]/recipeMaker/recipeUsers</xpath>
            <value>
              <li>DMSE_MicrogravityFacility</li>
            </value>
          </match>
        </li>
      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>

</Patch>
